{"id":"dcf26d8932e8a0a9","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-forcing-intermediate-model.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Intermediate Model","display":"df-zfc-forcing-intermediate-model — ZFC Forcing Intermediate Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-intermediate-model","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-intermediate-model"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-intermediate-model — ZFC Forcing Intermediate Model","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing-extension]]","[[58-df-model]]","[[58-df-transitive-set]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-intermediate-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-intermediate-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-intermediate-model — ZFC Forcing Intermediate Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"52c60ab550f6f214\" href=\"?note=52c60ab550f6f214\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-extension\">58-df-zfc-forcing-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"58-df-model\">58-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"58-df-transitive-set\">58-df-transitive-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> (ground model)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> (forcing extension of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in V\">\\(P\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq P\">\\(G\\subseteq P\\)</span> (forcing poset and generic filter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (intermediate model)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span> (the membership language) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> (the ZFC theory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}_S\\)</span> (model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"58-df-model\">58-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\\)</span> (transitive-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"58-df-transitive-set\">58-df-transitive-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcingExtension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcingExtension}_S\\)</span> (forcing-extension predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"52c60ab550f6f214\" href=\"?note=52c60ab550f6f214\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-extension\">58-df-zfc-forcing-extension</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingIntermediateModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingIntermediateModel}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}intermediate\\text{-}model}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcForcingIntermediateModel}_S(M,V,N,G,P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ForcingExtension}_S(N,V,G,P)\n\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(V)\\land\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\langle V,\\in\\cap(V\\times V)\\rangle,\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathcal L_\\in)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\langle M,\\in\\cap(M\\times M)\\rangle,\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathcal L_\\in)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(N)\\land\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\langle N,\\in\\cap(N\\times N)\\rangle,\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land V\\subseteq M\\subseteq N\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{\\alpha\\in V:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}=\\{\\alpha\\in M:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}=\\{\\alpha\\in N:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}intermediate\\text{-}model}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcForcingIntermediateModel}_S(M,V,N,G,P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ForcingExtension}_S(N,V,G,P)\n\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(V)\\land\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\langle V,\\in\\cap(V\\times V)\\rangle,\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathcal L_\\in)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\langle M,\\in\\cap(M\\times M)\\rangle,\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathcal L_\\in)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(N)\\land\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\langle N,\\in\\cap(N\\times N)\\rangle,\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land V\\subseteq M\\subseteq N\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{\\alpha\\in V:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}=\\{\\alpha\\in M:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}=\\{\\alpha\\in N:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The extension <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>, forcing carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>, and generic filter <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> are explicit arguments; the undefined context-dependent term <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V[G]\">\\(V[G]\\)</span> has been removed.</li>\n<li>The ZFC-model and transitivity requirements are now reduced to the actual model and transitive-set predicates instead of undeclared prose-style abbreviations.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-extension","status":"resolved","id":"52c60ab550f6f214","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"923884eb8fe4e61d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-transitive-set","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-transitive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"923884eb8fe4e61d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Model}_S$ (model predicate, see [[58-df-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-transitive-set","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S$ (transitive-set predicate, see [[58-df-transitive-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-extension","status":"resolved","id":"52c60ab550f6f214","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ForcingExtension}_S$ (forcing-extension predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-forcing-extension]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"G\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Model}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ForcingExtension}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingIntermediateModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}intermediate\\text{-}model}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{ZfcForcingIntermediateModel}_S(M,V,N,G,P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{ForcingExtension}_S(N,V,G,P)\n\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(V)\\land\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\langle V,\\in\\cap(V\\times V)\\rangle,\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathcal L_\\in)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\langle M,\\in\\cap(M\\times M)\\rangle,\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathcal L_\\in)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(N)\\land\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\langle N,\\in\\cap(N\\times N)\\rangle,\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land V\\subseteq M\\subseteq N\\\\\n&\\land\\{\\alpha\\in V:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}=\\{\\alpha\\in M:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}=\\{\\alpha\\in N:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"V[G]","display":false}],"bytes":2159,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1963","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-forcing-intermediate-model.md|58-df-zfc-forcing-intermediate-model]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","52c60ab550f6f214","923884eb8fe4e61d","c14ba496c480dcd6","5582a281f15a33c2"]}